<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Your {{ site_name() }} account</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #F2F6F3; color: #0E1411; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background: #F2F6F3;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 520px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3ECE6; border-radius: 24px;">
    <tr><td style="padding: 28px 32px 0;">
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr>
            <td style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 18px; background: #22D56B; font-size: 0; line-height: 0;">&nbsp;</td>
            <td style="padding-left: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E1411;">{{ site_name() }}</td>
        </tr></table>
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 20px 32px 30px;">
        <h1 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E1411;">Your account is ready</h1>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 22px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3832;">The operator of {{ site_name() }} opened an account for <strong>{{ organisation }}</strong> and made you the person who manages it. There is no password: you sign in with a link like the one below.{% if must_accept %} First you accept the service policy; then the account opens.{% endif %} The dashboard then shows the next steps. This link works once and expires in {{ minutes }} minutes.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;"><a href="{{ url }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 26px; background: #0E1411; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Sign in</a></p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4E5A53;">Or paste this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break: break-all; color: #0B6B35;">{{ url }}</span></p>
        <p style="margin: 18px 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #EEF3EF; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4E5A53;">When the link has expired, ask for a new one at <span style="word-break: break-all; color: #0B6B35;">{{ sign_in }}</span> with this address.</p>
    </td></tr>
    </table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
